[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2051.349, "timestamp": "00:34:11", "text": "跳一下嗎？ [音樂]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2055.43, "timestamp": "00:34:15", "text": "我明白了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2057.03, "timestamp": "00:34:17", "text": "。好的。 [音樂] 她在找東西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2065.589, "timestamp": "00:34:25", "text": "但問題是沒有沒有。是的，那個地方是。是的。明白了。明白了。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2078.977, "timestamp": "00:34:38", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "I can't hear anything what"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2086.869, "timestamp": "00:34:46", "text": "我覺得那裡好像有打架什麼的。我的天哪，達基。出去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2088.47, "timestamp": "00:34:48", "text": "你為什麼非要……我的天。我要走了。我的天哪。別擋在我前面。達基。達基。達基。走開。停下。那裡。是的，這裡什麼都沒有。我檢查過了。我的天哪。什麼都沒有。上樓去。上樓去。上樓去。樓上什麼都沒有"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2095.66, "timestamp": "00:34:55", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "okay now good phone issues"}]